OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for housing estate near entry
OL,4,Ato national park
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 150 homes could be built at
OL,7,Fthe gateway to a popular national park.
OL,9,FGleeson Homes is looking to build a
OL,10,F165-house development on the outskirts
OL,11,Fof Oxenholme, one of the main entry
OL,12,Fpoints to the Lake District via train
OL,13,Fand from the M6 via the A65.
OL,15,FDocuments submitted to Westmorland and
OL,16,FFurness Council show the development
OL,17,Fwould be off the A65 Burton Road, on
OL,18,Fgreenfield land between the train
OL,19,Ftracks on the edge of the hamlet and
OL,20,FBrow Head Farm.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
