OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for housing estate near entry
OL,4,Ato national park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose behind the scheme said a detailed
OL,7,Flayout was still being prepared and
OL,8,Fthey requested if the Liberal
OL,9,FDemocrat-led authority required what is
OL,10,Fknown as an environmental impact
OL,11,Fassessment (EIA).
